(b) ANY VIOLATION BY THE OTHER PARTY OF ANY LAW, STATUTE, ORDINANCE, REGULATION, RULE OR GOVERNMENTAL REQUIREMENT; 
(c) ANY CLAIM THAT THE SERVICES PROVIDED HEREUNDER INFRINGE UPON THE RIGHTS OF ANY THIRD PARTY; 
